# Allowlist: send only what the image builds from. Anything new in the repo (training outputs,
# .env files with keys, scratch data) stays out of the build context unless listed here.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src
!scripts

# Re-exclude junk inside the allowed dirs (src/unitree_vision_rl/logs and /wandb hold ~1 GB).
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/logs
**/wandb
**/*.pt
**/*.mp4
**/MUJOCO_LOG.TXT
**/.env*
